<title>USA: Glendale holders approve holding company.</title>
<headline>Glendale holders approve holding company.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDALE, California 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glendale Federal Bank said on Wednesday shareholders had approved the previously announced formation of a new holding company, to be called Golden State Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>The new formation would become effective on July 24, the company said, when shares of Glendale Federal Bank's common stock will automatically become an equal number of shares of Golden State Bancorp Inc common stock.</p>
</text>
